1.0.2 Released on September 2nd, 2026.
 - Refactor: split CardDiscarded into PhaseState helpers (<150 L) with FixupOverlappedSlot and AnimatePendingCaptures.
 - Fix: victory OK flush and Mekuri month 13→12 off-by-one.
 - Modernize: va()→va_str/std::format, SurfacePtr RAII for CBox/RulesMenu, dealer globals into CGame, INI Load/Save to std::string/getline, layout constants, noreturn/docs.
 - AI: extend Config with goalHandBonus/goalDeskBonus and layout centralization.

1.0.1 Released on September 2nd, 2026.
 - Performance: reuse persistent streaming SDL_Texture in CGeneral::UpdateScreen, eliminating per-frame create/destroy and fixing VMware GPU corruption.
 - Refactor: extract CGame helpers (FindMatchingCards, ChooseSlotForPair, CapturePair/Triple, ValidateInitialDesk) and reduce CardDiscarded duplication; fix uninitialized warnings.
 - Modernize: replace strtok/char buffers with std::vector/std::getline, va() fixed formats with std::format/to_string, and #define code-gen macros with lambdas.
 - AI: externalize 22 bot heuristics to CBot::Config with INI [BOT] tuning and named documentation.
 - Core: add inline App()/Window()/Renderer()/Screen() accessors and AppContext guidance, deprecate global macros.
 - Audio: make g_fAudioOpened std::atomic<bool> for thread visibility.
 - Font: handle 4-byte UTF-8 (emoji/CJK ext) gracefully in bitmap fallback without TerminateOnError.

1.0.0 Released on August 22nd, 2026.
 - Added In-Game Scrollable Rules Canvas Viewer displaying 100% of Hanafuda deck rules, Yaku combinations, and card sprite illustrations from RULES.md across a 545px viewport.
 - Implemented interactive scrollbar thumb dragging, high-precision mouse wheel scrolling, keyboard arrow navigation, and viewport click-scrolling.
 - Implemented authentic Hanafuda dealer selection (Mekuri card cut animation) selecting the lowest month card draw as first-round dealer.
 - Implemented winner-retains-dealer round progression and 12-round Hanafuda match victory condition.
 - Enhanced UI text rendering with 2D horizontal/vertical centering and dark navy high-contrast title typography.
 - Updated repository documentation (RULES.md, ChangeLog, README.md).

0.35 Released on August 21st, 2026.
 - Major codebase modernization to C++23, SDL3, SDL3_mixer, SDL3_ttf, and CMake 3.25+.
 - Added 12-round match victory condition (January through December) with HUD round tracking and final match win/loss screen.
 - Upgraded card graphics to high-resolution vector Hanafuda set with authentic traditional colors and red card backs.
 - Configured native macOS App Bundle (SDLHana.app) packaging with automated .icns icon generation.
 - Standardized application per-user storage path under "CarneSoft" organization namespace.
 - Added automated GitHub Actions release packaging for Windows, macOS, and Linux standalone archives.
 - Added per-OS CI status badges and documentation for Game Modes, Supported Languages, and GNU Savannah project history.
 - Added optional developer tools build flag (-DSDLHANA_BUILD_TOOLS=ON) and removed legacy Autotools Makefiles.
 - Integrated cross-platform application window icon and native Windows executable resource.
 - Fixed game score initialization across sessions and isolated Korean-specific scoring rules.
